la rovescia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Prince Hydron rebels against Spectre when his subjects retreat from New Vestroia. Meanwhile, Marucho battles to rescue his Bakugan from his bronze prison.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-09-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/znQRPdiIXPatDN6XJ8xxrU2RMnS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/znQRPdiIXPatDN6XJ8xxrU2RMnS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/25"},{"id":"782020","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Di nuovo insieme","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Marucho faces a final test to rescue all the Bakugan from Prince Hydron's throne room and Drago discovers an awesome power that makes him travel with the Brawlers.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-10-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hnGlN7qnuimEUMFsfY9I786QWJy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hnGlN7qnuimEUMFsfY9I786QWJy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/26"},{"id":"782021","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Sei gradi di distruzione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After King Zenoheld creates the Bakugan Termination System and defeats the six ancient warriors for their attribute energies, the warriors sacrifice themselves to evolve Drago and the other Bakugan, warning Dan and his friends that New Vestroia is in danger.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w1l1advNDJ2dIRSbhxq3rFOTAen.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w1l1advNDJ2dIRSbhxq3rFOTAen.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/27"},{"id":"782022","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"La vendetta dei Vexos","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As King Zenoheld sends the Vexos to steal the Six Elemental Attributes, Baron Leltoy is defeated by Prince Hydron in battle, losing the Haos energy and racing to warn the Resistance before the others are targeted.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fagtihobF7bGdrkrJtgMsZknvzI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fagtihobF7bGdrkrJtgMsZknvzI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/28"},{"id":"782023","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Salvati dalla sirena","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Ace Grit searches for a home for Baron, he battles Mylene Farrow for the Darkus Energy and, with help from Klaus Von Hertzon and Sirenoid, manages to drive her away before the Vexos can claim it.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n19lysmcB1ZNBZvVLE4oby8h9nn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n19lysmcB1ZNBZvVLE4oby8h9nn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/29"},{"id":"782024","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Il giorno in cui Nuova Vestronia rimase ferma","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After learning the Vexos are targeting the attribute energies, Shun Kazami travels to New Vestroia, where Master Ingram overcomes self-doubt and defeats Lync Volan to protect the Ventus energy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dsitwfklE7GQPbZSbl5C2SprR1P.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dsitwfklE7GQPbZSbl5C2SprR1P.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/30"},{"id":"782002","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Spectra risorge","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At Klaus' Mansion, Dan Kuso defeats Spectra Phantom in a fierce battle with the help of his friends and Drago’s newly gained power, while Spectra vows they will battle again.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fGaaCzbojOxTPRaoLj5X4RjL5by.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fGaaCzbojOxTPRaoLj5X4RjL5by.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/31"},{"id":"782025","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"L'attacco di Shadow","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Spectra Phantom deceives the people of Vestal, Alice Gehabich briefly overcomes her fear of becoming Masquerade to battle Shadow Prove, whose victory destroys the Resistance’s transporter system and traps Dan’s group on Vestal.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3RoeKMRHkdX0Nv1GHCl1M6TjIVj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3RoeKMRHkdX0Nv1GHCl1M6TjIVj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/32"},{"id":"782003","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Brontes tradito","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"King Zenoheld tries to get the Brawlers to return to Earth. The team suspect that it is a trap when they return home, as Shadow Prove's attack on Alice has been made public.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dK6bpUlM8Ws1JCt7EUD0l7DE9Xr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dK6bpUlM8Ws1JCt7EUD0l7DE9Xr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/33"},{"id":"781987","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Gli invasori della Terra","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Brawlers return back to Earth and see Shun, Runo and Julie waiting for them.  In order to evade the Vexos, everyone stays at Marucho's house which is equipped with a shield to hide the attribute energies' signal.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pAQPYSdoq4zfihajdiyeT9JXxlu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pAQPYSdoq4zfihajdiyeT9JXxlu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/34"},{"id":"781988","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"La fuga di Elfin","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Brawlers continue to hide out from the Vexos in Marucho's mansion, protected by the Barrier Shield. However, Elfin is restless and begins talking big about facing off with the Vexos.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u7xBIFwPsnptPUFEMm3oizqjcHd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u7xBIFwPsnptPUFEMm3oizqjcHd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/35"},{"id":"781996","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"La resa dei conti del samurai","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Brawlers continue to hide out from the Vexos in Marucho's mansion, when they are paid a surprise visit by Baron's sister Maron. Having already lost his Bakugan's Attribute Energy to the Vexos, Baron decides it is safe to take her out to see the sites.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/prwTUjNZMovN7s0Yo3fQkCQy15c.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/prwTUjNZMovN7s0Yo3fQkCQy15c.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/36"},{"id":"781998","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Pazzia virtuale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Brawlers continue to hide from the Vexos in Marucho's mansion, when they are paid a surprise visit by their old pal Billy. They now learn that Marucho has built a virtual reality system where they can Brawl without fear of losing their Attribute Energies to the Vexos.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dIWY9UHQcXxTeT68uoDisFArzv8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dIWY9UHQcXxTeT68uoDisFArzv8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/37"},{"id":"782027","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Tutto o niente","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the Brawlers' hiding spot now exposed, the pressure is on. Dan comes up with a plan to storm the Mother Palace in a pre-emptive strike on the Vexos. The only problem is that the Brawlers don't know where the Palace is.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fC8f6ZcqffRzV9j4VTwp8ovvaD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fC8f6ZcqffRzV9j4VTwp8ovvaD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/38"},{"id":"781986","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Vendicando Spectra","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Spectra makes good on his bet with Dan and takes the Brawlers to the Mother Palace; once there, the Brawlers immediately take off in search of the Battle Termination System in order to destroy it.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9cLtMj1lUXWropcO1kOWgkwROLx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9cLtMj1lUXWropcO1kOWgkwROLx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/39"},{"id":"782026","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"L'agguato","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Dan and the Brawlers continue their search for the Bakugan Termination System, they run into an ambush by the Palace Guards. The Brawlers are forced to separate.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gb8iiaukgj7RwOEC2VIsGEp8KPJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gb8iiaukgj7RwOEC2VIsGEp8KPJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/40"},{"id":"782028","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"La battaglia finale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Unaware that the battlefield is a trap, Dan and Spectra engage in a brawl with Prince Hydron. Soon the other Brawlers show up and reveal that the deck has been stacked by the Vexos.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sRdD75Oiv6fU52ZXVtzzGZ2bL1Q.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sRdD75Oiv6fU52ZXVtzzGZ2bL1Q.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/41"},{"id":"781997","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"L'esodo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the Bakugan Termination System fired up and seconds away from being fully operational, the Brawlers begin a large-scale evacuation of Bakugan from New Vestroia.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ccS3bbOizDh5Ta18R4UXPAK9Y7J.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ccS3bbOizDh5Ta18R4UXPAK9Y7J.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/42"},{"id":"781999","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"L'attacco dei dati fantasma","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the Bakugan Termination System destroyed, the Brawlers head back to Earth. The gang encounters a group of strange and unfamiliar Bakugan who appear to want to battle but have no Brawlers to work with.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-03-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/83eP2pOVOweq6b8rpDmToBPbzkr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/83eP2pOVOweq6b8rpDmToBPbzkr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/43"},{"id":"782029","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"L'ultimo attacco di Spectra","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the Brawlers back on Earth and life getting back to normal, it does not take long for Spectra to show up and throw a spanner in the works.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-03-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9gJ1NSyokDmgyCrwWmrqsNWQgWI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9gJ1NSyokDmgyCrwWmrqsNWQgWI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/44"},{"id":"782030","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Fusione e confusione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After Marucho demonstrates that the Brawlers' phantom data is the same as the data Keith received, the newest member of the Brawlers convinces them to let him outfit Drago with Battle Gear.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/agwzeXJlHQy8YiUV8BmO5zU3EWq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/agwzeXJlHQy8YiUV8BmO5zU3EWq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/45"},{"id":"782031","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"La rivolta di Volt","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Zenoheld declares that he is going to use Clay's Alternative Weapons System to destroy Earth and Vestal, Volt decides that he has had enough.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bvYHOqSwmHR1352ZsBjb89jJmYO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bvYHOqSwmHR1352ZsBjb89jJmYO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/46"},{"id":"782032","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"La rivincita","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Professor Clay reveals to Zenoheld that in order to finish the Alternative he will require the DNA Code and the Battle Gear Data from the Brawlers. Mylene is immediately dispatched to retrieve it.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6z6Xea4KA1bYg9RaEnGniFNWcVy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6z6Xea4KA1bYg9RaEnGniFNWcVy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/47"},{"id":"782033","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Il crollo di Mylene","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mylene finds herself next in line to try and retrieve the data Zenoheld requires to complete the Alternative weapons system.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pLbmUJX7eu7CTh0qtdSne3hGb81.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pLbmUJX7eu7CTh0qtdSne3hGb81.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/48"},{"id":"782034","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Un erede da risparmiare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mylene's Death Ball causes the collapse of Bakugan Interspace. Marucho makes a desperate attempt to contain the destruction, but is only able to evacuate Mira and Keith.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6vDeycVLCKutyQNP8p4SZ4muE6w.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6vDeycVLCKutyQNP8p4SZ4muE6w.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/49"},{"id":"782035","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":50,"title":{"value":"L'arma finale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hydron discovers that a fellow prisoner is none other than Gus Grav, who was presumed dead.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5uKI3y16g34PrqLnC55k5fU56bi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5uKI3y16g34PrqLnC55k5fU56bi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/50"},{"id":"782036","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":51,"title":{"value":"Tutti per uno","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Alice and Dr. Michael use the teleportation signature left behind by Shadow and Mylene to backtrack to the palace; Zenoheld continues his attack, forcing Spectra and Gus to retreat and come up with a plan to counter.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f2hiQ2vKP8L5CKqpj5IkuM77Wcq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2hiQ2vKP8L5CKqpj5IkuM77Wcq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/51"},{"id":"782004","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":52,"title":{"value":"Furia finale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shun guides the team through the Alternative, where the Brawlers fend off an attack from four mysterious Bakugan before they can shut down the ship's reactor.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tPhVezeNTdkTuW5LJUUYBCqnoYX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tPhVezeNTdkTuW5LJUUYBCqnoYX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2/episode/52"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/2"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"13":{"checkedAt":1793478151335,"status":"ok",